# Claude
#
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT ignored. Sessions run in ephemeral containers
# that clone this repo fresh, so an ignored CLAUDE.md exists only for the life
# of one session and its preferences are lost with it. Committing the file is
# what makes it apply to every future session.
#
# It holds working preferences and hard-won project traps, not secrets — check
# that stays true before adding to it.